# The ontop image is self-provisioning: the JDBC driver, ontology and mapping
# are baked in, and the DB connection comes from env vars (see README). Nothing
# here needs to be provided manually. These entries guard against accidentally
# committing a large ontology override, or a leftover legacy ontop.properties
# that may hold plaintext DB credentials.
ontology.owl
ontop.properties
